Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.27,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,The Demon Realm approaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:04.35,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You've estimated the potential damage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.98,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,and planned how we should distribute troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:08.68,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:11.40,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Just who do you think you are, Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:13.15,Flashback,Himari,0,0,0,,Miss Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:15.66,Flashback,Himari,0,0,0,,Would you like to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:20.01,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Escape? From this kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:22.88,Main - Top,Julius,0,0,0,,I made time to see you because you \Nsaid you had something to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:22.88,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}From this man who sold my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:23.79,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.05,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:50.92,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(710,1)\blur4\t(1,710,\blur0)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&HDA8FA9&}The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside\Nby My Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.92,0:00:50.92,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(960,1)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\3c&HFCFEFE&}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:02:01.89,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\shad1\bord0\fnGeorgia\fs10\c&HF9F8FA&\3c&H4E4E4E&\4c&H252526&\pos(515,283.044)}Episode 6\N"{\fs12\c&HBDE53E&}Reason {\c&HF9F8FA&\fs10}and {\fs12\c&HBDE53E&}Emotion{\fs10\c&HF9F8FA&}"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:01.89,Main - Top,Julius,0,0,0,,You're starting to take on \Nyour sister's bad habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:05.89,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Listen here. Politics is a man's domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:11.84,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Furnish funds and forces for something\Nthat {\i1}might{\i0} happen every few {\i1}centuries{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:13.57,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,What an outrageous suggestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:15.94,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,These things cost money, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:17.94,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,If I may be so bold, Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.94,0:02:24.20,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Were you not generously compensated \Nwhen my sister was sent to Parnacorta?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:27.00,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Oh, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.10,0:02:36.01,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,1)\fnArial\b1\fs20\shad0\pos(209.761,275.878)\3c&H383533&}*Concept
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.53,0:02:32.68,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I've already spent most of it on a giant \Ngold statue of the Girtonian royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.68,0:02:36.01,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,to be unveiled on the anniversary\Nof our nation's founding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:39.59,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}This kingdom might really be doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:39.59,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I'll make a gold statue of you too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:39.59,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial Black\an8\3c&HFEF7FF&\c&H0F0072&}You spent the money you got for my sister on WHAT?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:41.22,Default,Attendant A,0,0,0,,P-Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:42.35,Default,King,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:46.85,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The king!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:52.06,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}After taking ill, he spends all his time\Nin his room and rarely sees anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:55.77,Default,King,0,0,0,,Mia, is the news of the \NDemon Realm's approach true?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:57.12,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:03:00.36,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Soon, ours will be a land of demons,\N unfit for human habitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.77,0:03:03.34,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Father, she's just a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.37,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,There's no need to listen to—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:06.16,Main - Top,King,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:10.52,Default,King,0,0,0,,Nobody knows more \Nabout monsters than a saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:14.17,Default,King,0,0,0,,Not satisfied to send Philia \Nto another kingdom without my say-so,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:16.56,Default,King,0,0,0,,you intend to ignore Mia's advice as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:18.01,Default,King,0,0,0,,You absolute fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:23.47,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it! Selling Philia \Nwas entirely the prince's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:27.40,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Father, that certainly wasn't {\i1}my{\i0} doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:31.60,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,She insisted on going to help\N our poor neighbors—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:37.28,Main - Top,King,0,0,0,,Even so, it was your duty—as both her \Nfiancé and prince of this realm—to stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:38.11,Default,King,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:39.62,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:42.50,Default,King,0,0,0,,Please continue, Mia—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:43.24,Default,Attendant A,0,0,0,,Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:45.26,Default,Attendant A,0,0,0,,Bring Saint Philia's medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.51,Default,Attendant A,0,0,0,,Isn't there any left?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:48.09,Default,Attendant B,0,0,0,,No, we're all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:50.16,Default,Attendant B,0,0,0,,We have what the castle herbalist made...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:53.71,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,What? Don't we have the \Nrecipe my sister left with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.00,Default,Attendant B,0,0,0,,I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.89,0:03:59.60,Default,Attendant B,0,0,0,,it was lost in error.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.76,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.24,Main - Top,Attendant A,0,0,0,,Fetch the best we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:04.51,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then the real reason\Nhe sent my sister away...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:11.49,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}He wants his father gone \Nso that he has free rein?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.49,0:04:13.27,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Now, Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.70,0:04:16.41,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Have a little faith in Girtonia's forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.41,0:04:21.11,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I firmly believe that any place they \Nguard is the safest in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:24.62,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's like he really thinks that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:27.83,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's even going to ignore \NHis Majesty's warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.45,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You needn't worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:31.45,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:33.12,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:37.56,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Despite your heartening reassurances, \NI simply find myself so frightened!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:38.34,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Squee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:38.34,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\shad0\bord1\c&H7049EA&\pos(70.736,145.96)\3c&HFCFFFE&}Squee
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:41.51,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Might I ask a favor? \NFor my duties tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:44.33,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Won't you kindly come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:51.63,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?! \NKill that thing already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:05:00.57,Main - Top,Julius,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry! Get this one now! This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:05:00.57,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}My plan was to bring him to the front line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:04.00,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The effects of the Demon Realm's \Napproach have grown stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:07.28,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}and it's common to see large \Ngroups of monsters spawn at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:11.79,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that he's seen it for himself,\Nhe'll have to come to his senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:14.66,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:20.59,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,M-Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:24.05,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm having a bit of stomach trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.05,0:05:25.92,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I think I might return to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:28.30,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:32.93,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Oh, Your Highness! You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:39.61,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Have you perhaps seen how very dangerous\Nthings have become due to my grave inadequacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:42.40,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,D-Dangerous? It's not dangerous at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:45.61,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You and Girtonia's top troops\Nare doing a bang-up job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:48.45,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this guy blind or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.88,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm shaken or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:54.43,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,My stomach's genuinely upset,\Nso I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:58.54,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Your Highness, however do you expect \Nto leave under these conditions?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:02.69,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Wh-Where did they come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:06.42,Main - Top,Mia,0,0,0,,If nothing is done, soon the entire \Nkingdom will be overrun in this fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:10.80,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Try to imagine it. A world where \Nnot even the capital is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:13.31,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I don't take orders from women!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:15.76,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You're trying to imitate Philia, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:19.31,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to be like this! \NYou're just supposed to stand back and smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:24.53,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Or are you trying to humiliate \Nme the way Philia did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.48,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been thinking for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:30.49,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}he's got some kind of inferiority \Ncomplex about my sister, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:37.91,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:41.38,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hiding behind his own fiancée? Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:45.17,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What right does he have \Nto tell a woman her place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.53,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Someone do something! I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:50.68,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.93,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,...fault. It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.93,0:06:59.16,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Yes, I see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:03.27,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,This is all Philia's fault for abandoning us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:06.98,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I'll recall her and make her slay\N all these monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:09.11,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is wrong with this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:12.79,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Parnacorta isn't going \Nto give my sister back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.79,0:07:16.25,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Not even if we pay double what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:19.12,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Not even if we pay double?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:21.37,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Philia's hardly worth that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:25.71,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,All she's good for is putting up \Na few halfway-decent barriers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:29.43,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Mia, what's gotten into you lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:33.05,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You're so charming. \NYou don't need to try to be like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:36.10,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You're going to be my wife someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:39.75,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Just do your job as unobtrusively as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:42.98,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter what I say, he won't learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:45.27,Main - Top,Julius,0,0,0,,Now, Mia, let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.59,0:07:47.86,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the Demon Realm approaching, \Nwhat should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:55.12,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Hey there, babe! Wanna take \Na little walk with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:57.83,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:02.96,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Need a hand with your things? You're \Ngorgeous! What's your name, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.85,0:08:05.83,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,You'd better...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:06.75,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:16.86,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.86,0:08:21.87,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,That was mean, Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.87,0:08:26.15,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Next time you do that, it won't just \Nbe your head. I'll slice you to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:28.40,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to avoid that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.65,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,I'll die if you slice up my you-know-what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.32,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:35.70,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,I'm here worried about the revival \Nof the archdemon Asmodeus,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:37.28,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,and you're as calm as can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.28,0:08:40.94,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,I mean, he and I are kind of family and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:43.41,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Doesn't he rank way higher than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:45.17,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Not {\i1}that{\i0} much higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:50.47,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,His soul was sealed away \Nby Saint Fianna four hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.47,0:08:53.36,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,but the approach of the Demon Realm\Nhas weakened the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:54.76,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,If something were to happen...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.76,0:08:57.09,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,He'd be back in a snap, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:09:00.26,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\blur4\c&H64838B&\3c&HEFF5F2&\b1\pos(183.539,291.225)}Erza's Familiar\N {\fs14\c&H2A4653&}Mammon the Demon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.09,0:09:00.26,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,That's why the church sent us, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:00.26,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,1)\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\blur4\c&H64838B&\3c&HEFF5F2&\b1\pos(486.697,74.49)}Archbishop's Personal Exorcist,\NChurch of Cremoux Main Branch\N {\fs14\c&H2A4653&} Erza Notice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.26,0:09:00.97,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:02.55,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:03.90,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,So let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:05.89,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:07.31,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:10.69,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Ever since I sold Philia off,\Nmy life's been unending misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:16.53,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,How badly must she humiliate \Nme before she's through?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:22.36,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since I was a child, I've done my best to live\Nup to the expectations of those around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:26.55,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}The crown prince is a useless shut-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:30.42,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone said it was the kingdom's \Nwunderkind, the second prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:32.42,Main - Italics,Julius,0,0,0,,who deserved to take the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:35.84,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a perfect life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:39.54,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes... until that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.61,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Perfect saint, my eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:46.02,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Physical beauty is all a woman needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:48.56,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Just smile and be charming already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:52.53,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,She tells men what to do, \Nand even ignores my opinions!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:55.52,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:56.71,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Marquis Pyrz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:09:57.99,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:01.12,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,I've been here for a while, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:03.45,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,I have some information for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:05.45,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:09.97,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,I believe it's time to show the saint...\Nrather, the brat you sold to our neighbor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:14.34,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,the true power of the kingdom's wunderkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:15.88,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,My true power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:16.72,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:23.20,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,Did you know that we still have a treasure \Nleft by Saint Fianna stored away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:26.06,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,A treasure of Fianna's?\N First I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:31.40,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,They say it lies beneath \Nthe church in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:35.53,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,It is a ring containing all the magic power \Nof the legendary Saint Fianna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:41.32,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,Whoever breaks the seal \Nwill gain tremendous power!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:46.74,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,If you were the one to do it\Nand wield such power...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:49.33,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,No one could tell me what to do ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:50.82,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:55.88,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,You could even show up that obnoxious \Nsaint in the next kingdom over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:57.36,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:11:00.71,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I'll show her my superiority!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.71,0:11:02.14,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Even Mia couldn't deny it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:04.51,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,And neither could my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:09.69,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I wish that old geezer \Nwould just die already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:18.90,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:22.75,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,When did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:24.03,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnGeorgia\b1\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\pos(323,110)}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:27.04,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,R-Return her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.36,0:11:30.58,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,We're supposed to send Saint Philia back {\i1}now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:34.17,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,It seems things in Girtonia \Nare worse than anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:38.48,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Obviously, we're well within \Nour rights to deny them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:40.13,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,but I wanted to inform you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:45.59,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to stay here in the capital to \Nmaintain the Great Purification Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:50.60,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I sent Himari \Nto help Mia work out a plan, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:55.36,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suspect Prince Julius has overruled her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:56.94,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:11:59.82,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:04.41,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Don't shoulder this burden alone.\NTake a look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:11.26,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,We just need to improve \Nconditions in Girtonia, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:13.16,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,As a potential compromise,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:17.82,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I've proposed sending Parnacorta's\N knights to aid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:19.21,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,The knights?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:20.54,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:23.66,Main - Top,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Not to boast, but they're quite competent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:27.05,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(310,810)\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H484A45&\3c&HFFFFFC&\move(240.996,300.979,243.446,293.02,310,3870)\t(\fs18)}Leonardo is a former knight
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:26.84,Main - Top,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'm sure they could be of service \Nto Miss Mia in Girtonia as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.43,0:12:32.37,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I feel some responsibility \Nfor the situation, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:34.06,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'd like to help her as much as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:37.69,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,So you don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:44.15,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Thank you, Prince Osvalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:51.51,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry. I should have offered you tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:53.21,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Lena, please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:54.52,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.35,0:13:00.67,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,At least she's learning to ask \Nfor help in her daily life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.67,0:13:04.97,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Yes, though I wish she'd ask \Nfor something just for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:06.84,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.13,0:13:17.11,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Open your eyes, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:22.45,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It worked. You've done very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:24.99,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Remember that feeling just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:25.75,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:27.86,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.37,0:13:31.16,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Saint Philia, I've received word from Himari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:33.55,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:41.57,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,I'd heard Girtonia's king was in poor health,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:43.30,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,but I never imagined...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:47.03,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,They destroyed the recipe \Nfor making his medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:48.05,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:52.56,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's more in Mia's letter \Nthat I haven't told them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:59.81,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's certain that Prince Julius is \Nbehind the machinations in Girtonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.81,0:14:02.82,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's trying to take him down politically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:07.86,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}My warm and kind sister who \Nnever wanted to hurt anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:10.07,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's prepared to go to such lengths?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:13.08,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's happening over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:17.76,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Let us send the recipe via Himari.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:22.16,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I've made improvements to it, \Nso it may even cure the king altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:25.74,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Also, tell Mia not to do anything reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:27.22,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:32.30,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}If the king recovers, \Nthe nations politics may stabilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:36.46,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Working with Parnacorta's knights \Nto defend the kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:38.18,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,should take some burden off of Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:39.75,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}She won't have to push herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.73,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}This will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.31,0:14:44.37,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}At least, it should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.37,0:14:47.27,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But for some reason, \NI feel like I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:50.74,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mia, please be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:57.83,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,So it turns out Prince Julius really is \Nthe one messing everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:15:02.60,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,I see. Shall I eliminate Prince Julius, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:04.88,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Kill him? That's quite a leap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:07.34,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,I think poison may be the most effective way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.34,0:15:10.43,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,For instance, a dart to the bloodstream\N from a blowpipe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:12.03,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,could spell an immediate demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:13.55,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:16.40,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,All we need to do is strip him of his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:21.53,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,If someone were to blame Parnacorta for the\Nassassination, it could lead to all-out war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:25.02,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,If you insist, I'll call off the murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:31.04,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Regarding the king's medicine, \NI'll ask Philia about it in my next missive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:32.28,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Yes, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:35.92,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Now, as for Prince Julius...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:38.37,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,How do you wish to handle him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:41.16,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,How do I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:46.80,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I want him to pay in full \Nfor how he treated my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:51.35,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,apologize sincerely,\Nrepent his foolishness, and,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.35,0:15:53.18,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,after he's stripped of status and fortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:55.93,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I want him thrown out of the kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:16:00.85,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Through your position as saint,\Nthat might well be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.81,0:16:07.35,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right. I'm the saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.35,0:16:11.01,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The protector of this kingdom \Nand the savior of its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:13.82,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I really act on such a personal grudge?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:19.05,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}When this is all over, will I \Nstill be able to remain saint?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:25.00,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't even remember the kind \Nof saint I wanted to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.08,0:16:28.13,Flashback - Top,Tutor,0,0,0,,That's all for lessons today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:28.13,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(380,1)\shad0\bord1.5\fnArial\fs20\an3\pos(602.239,291.674)\3c&H29293D&}Adenauer Household  3 Years Prior
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:30.67,Flashback,Tutor,0,0,0,,You did very well, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:31.55,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.59,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,390)\bord1.5\shad0\fs18\fnArial\b1\pos(320,297.918)\c&H2A2422&\3c&HF6F6F6&}Mia Adenauer, Age 15
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.75,Flashback - Top,Tutor,0,0,0,,That's right. I heard the news!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:37.53,Flashback,Tutor,0,0,0,,Your older sister, Philia, \Ngot her certification,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:39.60,Flashback,Tutor,0,0,0,,and tomorrow she'll make\Nher debut as a saint!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:40.70,Flashback,Tutor,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:44.69,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,Y-Yes... Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:47.81,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}N-No one said anything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:49.57,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\shad0\bord1.5\pos(320,279.551)\3c&H3A3230&\b1}The Next Day
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:54.55,Flashback - Top,Mia,0,0,0,,Why didn't Mother and \NFather tell me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.55,0:16:56.26,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,Listen, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:17:02.85,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,It was Philia's idea to leave home and train \Nat the church to become a proper saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:09.38,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,To respect her wishes, we should \Nlimit contact with her in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:13.03,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}My sister, Philia, is one year older than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:15.82,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}For as long as I can remember,\Nwe haven't lived together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:17.64,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've barely ever gotten to talk to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:20.14,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,Even though we're sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:23.50,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's all the more reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.75,0:17:30.94,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've just gotta find out more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:36.96,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}As part of my sister's saintly debut,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:40.62,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}she's going to create Pillars \Nof Light near the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:50.75,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}That might be a shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:57.70,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,I even put on a disguise so that my mother \Nwon't recognize me if she spots me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:02.91,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}A monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:08.19,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}How?! There's a barrier around the capital!\NIt's supposed to be safe here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:12.77,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:16.49,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know it's my own fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:21.45,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I come from a saintly bloodline,\N yet I never trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:24.19,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I thought I could \Nleave it all to my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:26.44,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I never bothered to learn anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:30.00,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not even how dangerous it \Nis outside the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:32.79,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Help me, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:34.59,Flashback,Philia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.64,0:18:42.14,Flashback,Philia,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:44.55,Flashback,Philia,0,0,0,,I hope I made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:48.02,Flashback,Hildegard,0,0,0,,Philia, where have you gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:47.23,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,119)\fs30\bord1\fax.1\b1\fnArial Black\shad0\an8\pos(252.019,147.184)\frz344.8\c&HC7652A&\3c&H833718&}GASP
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:52.52,Flashback,Philia,0,0,0,,I'll call the guard. I must return \Nto the ceremony. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:18:59.10,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,She's like a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:03.66,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,That was my reintroduction to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:05.79,Flashback - Top,People,0,0,0,,Wow, two pillars already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:06.66,Flashback - Top,People,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:09.76,Flashback - Top,People,0,0,0,,Our new saint is the most \Npowerful in history by far!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:09.76,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,She's incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:11.19,Flashback - Top,People,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:12.98,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,I wanted to become a saint like Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:16.34,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,That's right... {\i0}That's{\i1} \Nwhat I wished for that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:19.39,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,To help people regardless of standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:21.78,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,To become a shield protecting my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:26.85,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,The greatest saint of all time, \Nmy role model, my north star...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:31.88,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,my sister always took to the front\N line with all her might.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:38.39,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,Even when she was outcast, even \Nwhen she left, she didn't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:42.90,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,She didn't blame anyone, spite \Nanyone, or consider revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.90,0:19:46.24,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,She just silently prayed \Nfor the safety of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:48.75,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:54.38,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I can't sacrifice that \Nfor the sake of my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.60,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,But... I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:20:00.76,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,The people who were so cruel \Nto the person I admire, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.29,0:20:04.22,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I hate them! I hate them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:10.05,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I understand things rationally, \Nbut my emotions won't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.05,0:20:11.39,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I'm all jumbled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:13.06,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:14.15,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Miss Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:16.16,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,That's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:21.43,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Remain true to yourself and be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:25.91,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself to become Saint Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.21,0:20:30.41,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,It's not always good for there to be\N an obvious right and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:34.53,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Moreover, a person's true heart \Nis not always clear to themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:37.62,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,There are a million ways for it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.62,0:20:41.42,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,As long as you press forward, I believe you'll\N work through your feelings someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.52,0:20:47.50,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,You should be who you are, \Nworking to save the kingdom in your own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.13,0:20:50.30,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,In my own way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:56.31,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's going to be even harder\Nthan choking back my anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.31,0:21:01.30,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nevertheless, this fury... let it be the \Nkindling that sets my heart ablaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:05.03,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if it's hard, even if it hurts,\N I'll do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.62,0:21:08.24,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Fine. Then let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:13.54,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep hating that awful man \Nand, as part of my saintly obligations,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:18.06,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I shall expose his rotten schemes\Nand completely break him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:23.01,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Selfish as I am, I demand both the \Nsalvation of my kingdom {\i1}and{\i0} revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:28.35,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,That's the way the 29th saint, \NMia Adenauer, does things!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:32.72,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,What shall we do first, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:38.57,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,First, I need someone else to entrust\N political matters to until the king recovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:40.02,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:40.69,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:45.61,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Indeed, there is someone else\N in the kingdom suited to the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:49.95,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,We'll call upon the crown prince confined\Nto his room by Prince Julius's supporters...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:54.14,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Prince Fernand!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.87,0:23:32.68,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside by \NMy Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:35.01,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Next time, episode 7:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.02,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\shad1\bord0\fs18\fnGeorgia\c&HFBFFFF&\3c&H0F0F10&\4c&H302E2C&\pos(320,67.102)\b1}Next Time
